WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
Still Point — Train attention. Return to stillness.

00:12.000 --> 00:22.000
Start at one minute. Each session begins small.

00:24.000 --> 00:34.000
Blocks fill as seconds pass. Watch time without thinking.

00:36.000 --> 00:46.000
Tap "I'm thinking" when your mind wanders. Capture the thought, then return.

00:48.000 --> 00:58.000
Add ten seconds each day. Build a daily rhythm naturally.
